    "original":"tatra guhyakādhipate sarvabhāvavigatam iti laukikamārgaparityāga eva tathāgatena saṃdarśitaḥ | na punar atrātmā sattvo jantur vā manujo vā saṃvidyate | api tu skandhadhātvāyatanādīni | skandhadhātvāyatanagrāhyagrāhavivarjitam iti | śrāvakamārgābhisamayaparijñāmukhena bodhisattvānāṃ mahāyānābhisamayo vyavasthāpitaḥ | dharmanairātmyasamatayā tu mantramukhabodhisattvacaryācāriṇo bodhisattvāḥ svacittam ādyanutpannaṃ paśyantaḥ śūnyatāsvabhāvam adravyam alakṣaṇam abhisaṃbudhyante | tasmā tarhi guhyakādhipate bodhisattvenālayānāvaraṇasarvaprapañcarahitaṃ cittam utpādayitavyam |",
