    "original":"atha bhagavān vairocanaḥ punar api vajrapāṇiṃ guhyakādhipatim āmantrayate sma | iha guhyakādhipate guhyasāramudrāmaṇḍalasamayam avatartukāmena bodhisattvena pañca dharmāḥ dūrataḥ parivarjayitavyāḥ | katame pañca | mātsaryaṃ sattveṣv āghātaḥ vicikitsā ālasyam agauravatā mantrādiṣu | ete dharmā guhyakādhipate ihaiva janmani lokottarāṃ pratipadam avatartukāmair bodhisattvair ete dūrataḥ parivarjayitavyāḥ | nāhaṃ guhyakādhipate tasya bodhisattvasya eṣu dharmeṣu sthitasya svalpām api bodhisattvacaryāparipūriṃ vadāmi | tat kasmād dhetor ma-",
